<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" type="device"><diagram id="p0" name="1 · The improvement loop"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" page="1" pageWidth="1120" pageHeight="920" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="n1" value="ux-quality-score: improving an interface to a target, unattended" style="text;html=1;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1040" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n2" value="Blue: the orchestrator. Green: the scripts. Yellow: blind reviewer agents. Orange: decisions and cases that need care. Grey: notes. Thick green border: an end state." style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="42" width="1040" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" value="&lt;b&gt;Set up once, with the user&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;config.json: personas, journeys, screen sizes, roles&lt;br&gt;capture.json: how to reach each step&lt;br&gt;Control journey: planted defects and things known to be right, captured once&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;The user approves this list: it defines what the scores mean&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="320" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" value="&lt;b&gt;Stage 1 · Fix what the measurements show&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Capture every journey; read facts/, keyboard/, motion/:&lt;br&gt;contrast, overflow, target sizes, labels, focus, reduced motion&lt;br&gt;Fix product-wide, capture again, confirm with regress&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;No reviewers, no agent cost&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="80" width="320" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" value="&lt;b&gt;Survives interruptions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;improve.md: the instruction, the open run, what each round changed&lt;br&gt;ledger.jsonl: one line per scored run, append-only&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;status&lt;/i&gt; and &lt;i&gt;progress&lt;/i&gt; say what to do next from the files alone" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="80" width="320" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e6" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n3" target="n4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n7" value="Stage 2 · One journey at a time, fresh reviewers every round" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=2;dashed=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#999999;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="250" width="1040" height="420" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n8" value="&lt;b&gt;new-run --unit J&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;on a committed state" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="300" width="180" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n9" value="&lt;b&gt;capture.cjs, then regress&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;screens · text · facts · probes" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="300" width="180" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n10" value="&lt;b&gt;Blind review&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;6 roles × 2 fresh agents&lt;br&gt;each: score, reason, issues" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="300" width="180" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n11" value="&lt;b&gt;collect, then challenge&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;validate; a second look at each major only one reviewer reported" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="670" y="300" width="180" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n12" value="&lt;b&gt;score&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;role scores · fix order · ledger line" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="300" width="180" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n13" value="&lt;b&gt;progress --target 90&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="420" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n14" value="Journey state?" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="405" width="200" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n15" value="&lt;b&gt;A role below target, or its reviewers 25+ apart&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fix the top of the fix order through the project's own process, then commit" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="405" width="270" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n16" value="&lt;b&gt;Stalled&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;two rounds gaining under 2 points: waits until no other journey is open. Only stalled left is a plateau: stop and ask the user" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="560" width="260" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n17" value="&lt;b&gt;Every role at target, agreed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;next journey" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontStyle=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="580" width="180" height="65" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e18" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n4" target="n8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e19" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n8" target="n9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e20" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n9" target="n10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e21" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n10" target="n11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e22" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n11" target="n12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e23" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n12" target="n13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e24" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n13" target="n14"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e25" value="not there yet" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n14" target="n15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e26" value="next round" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;entryX=0.7;entryY=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n15" target="n8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e27" value="stalled" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n14" target="n16"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="740" y="605"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e28" value="the user's answer" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n16" target="n15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="195" y="605"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e29" value="at target" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.75;exitY=0.75;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n14" target="n17"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="790" y="530"/><mxPoint x="960" y="530"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n30" value="&lt;b&gt;Stage 3 · Every journey together&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;One full run of all journeys plus the control journey&lt;br&gt;Fresh reviewers; nothing from earlier rounds reaches them" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="720" width="440" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n31" value="Target met?" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="705" width="200" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n32" value="every role of every journey at 90 or more&lt;br&gt;the reviewers of each role less than 25 apart&lt;br&gt;controls: enough defects caught" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="840" width="260" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n33" value="&lt;b&gt;Done&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Report the six role scores, the reasons behind the weakest, and how strict the reviewers were" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontStyle=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="830" y="720" width="250" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e34" value="no journey left to work on one at a time" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.2;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n7" target="n30"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e35" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n30" target="n31"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e36" value="yes" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n31" target="n33"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e37" value="no: a journey fell back or reviewers disagree" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;entryX=0.63;entryY=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n31" target="n7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="p1" name="2 · One scoring run: who knows what"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" page="1" pageWidth="1120" pageHeight="880" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="n1" value="One scoring run: who knows what" style="text;html=1;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1040" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n2" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#cccccc;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="60" width="1060" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" value='Orchestrator&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:normal"&gt;knows everything,&lt;br&gt;judges nothing&lt;/span&gt;' style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="60" width="170" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#cccccc;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="230" width="1060" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" value='uxq.cjs&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:normal"&gt;does all the arithmetic&lt;/span&gt;' style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="230" width="170" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n6" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#cccccc;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="400" width="1060" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n7" value='Blind reviewers&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight:normal"&gt;one folder, one use,&lt;br&gt;only that folder&lt;/span&gt;' style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="400" width="170" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n8" value="&lt;b&gt;Capture the screens&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;capture.cjs and regress, then look: right state, nothing dev-only on screen" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="220" y="95" width="180" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n9" value="&lt;b&gt;Start one fresh agent per entry&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;exactly the printed prompt, all at once, adding nothing" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="430" y="95" width="200" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n10" value="&lt;b&gt;Report, then fix the product&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;never edit, drop or re-score a result" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="95" width="200" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n11" value="&lt;b&gt;bundle&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;one folder per reviewer, each alone under a random parent" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="220" y="265" width="180" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n12" value="&lt;b&gt;collect, challenge&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;validate, store, delete the folder; a second look at a lone major" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="265" width="160" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n13" value="&lt;b&gt;score&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;hold, average, check agreement, rank fixes" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="265" width="180" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n14" value="Five specialists, each with its own rubric, 2 agents each" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=2;dashed=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#999999;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=6;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="215" y="420" width="600" height="225" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n15" value="&lt;b&gt;Accessibility&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A1–A10: contrast, labels, keyboard, structure, motion" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="230" y="455" width="180" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n16" value="&lt;b&gt;Visual design&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;V1–V9: hierarchy, spacing, type, colour, finish" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="425" y="455" width="180" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n17" value="&lt;b&gt;Interaction&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;I1–I12: feedback, errors, ways out, motion, control states" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="455" width="180" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n18" value="&lt;b&gt;Content&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;C1–C9: names, plain words, honesty, labels" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="230" y="550" width="180" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n19" value="&lt;b&gt;Responsive design&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;R1–R8: fit, touch targets, text size, reshaping" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="425" y="550" width="180" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n20" value="&lt;b&gt;All five see&lt;/b&gt;: the journey, screens, text, measurements; some also the keyboard walk, control states, motion. &lt;b&gt;Each returns&lt;/b&gt;: score 0–100, reason, issues." style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="550" width="185" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n21" value="&lt;b&gt;Target user&lt;/b&gt; × 2&lt;br&gt;who you are, what you want, your device&lt;br&gt;one step at a time: screen-01, screen-02 …&lt;br&gt;no step names, no expectations, no other sizes&lt;br&gt;says how each step went, then a score and why" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="835" y="420" width="245" height="225" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e22" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n8" target="n11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e23" value="folder + one-line prompt" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n11" target="n9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e24" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.52;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n9" target="n14"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e25" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.8;exitY=1;entryX=0.3;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n9" target="n21"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="590" y="395"/><mxPoint x="908" y="395"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e26" value="judgment.json" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.92;exitY=0;entryX=0.25;entryY=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n14" target="n12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e27" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.1;exitY=0;entryX=0.75;entryY=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n21" target="n12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e28" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n12" target="n13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e29" value="scorecard" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;entryX=0.7;entryY=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n13" target="n10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n30" value='&lt;b&gt;The only words a reviewer receives:&lt;/b&gt; "Open the folder &amp;lt;path&amp;gt; and read README.md there. Do exactly what it asks, using only the files in that folder."&lt;br&gt;The path carries no run, journey, round or role name. No reviewer knows there is a loop, other reviewers, an earlier review, a fix or a hoped-for score.' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="220" y="675" width="880" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n31" value="&lt;b&gt;Never:&lt;/b&gt; fork this conversation into a reviewer · add a word to the prompt · reuse a reviewer · show one reviewer another's result · tune the config, journeys or capture to dodge an issue · add reviewers until the scores happen to agree" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="220" y="760" width="880" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="p2" name="3 · How a score is computed"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" page="1" pageWidth="1120" pageHeight="940" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="n1" value="How a score is computed (rubric 5.0.0)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1040" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n2" value="Five specialists" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="50" width="480" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" value="The target user" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="50" width="480" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" value="&lt;b&gt;Each specialist reads its own rubric&lt;/b&gt; and returns a score from 0 to 100 on one scale: 90+ exemplary, 75–89 minor issues only, 50–74 a major issue, below that worse. With the reason, and every issue naming a criterion, a severity and a screen." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="480" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" value="&lt;b&gt;The result must hold together&lt;/b&gt;: below 100 needs at least one issue, or it is rejected. A major only one reviewer reported gets a second look: kept or lowered, never raised." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="210" width="480" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n6" value='&lt;b&gt;Held to its own issues&lt;/b&gt;: with a blocker it counts as 24 at most, with a major 74 at most. Minor and polish set no ceiling.&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;The scorecard shows every "gave 85, counted 74".&lt;/i&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="300" width="480" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n7" value="&lt;b&gt;The user goes step by step&lt;/b&gt;: smooth, hesitated, struggled or gave up; trouble of kinds U1–U5 (lost, unclear words, doubt, not for me, extra work). At the end: finished sure, unsure or no, a score from 0 to 100 and why." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="80" width="480" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n8" value="&lt;b&gt;Severity follows the step&lt;/b&gt;: gave up = blocker, struggled = major, hesitated = minor. Finished unsure holds the score to 74, not finished to 24." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="210" width="480" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n9" value="&lt;b&gt;Same rules after that&lt;/b&gt;: below 100 needs trouble somewhere; the score is held to its own issues." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="300" width="480" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n10" value="&lt;b&gt;A role's score for a journey = the mean of its reviewers' counted scores&lt;/b&gt; (with &quot;floor&quot;: held to the lowest ceiling any of them set)&lt;br&gt;journey overall = mean of its roles · application role score = mean over journeys, weighted" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontStyle=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="260" y="420" width="600" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e11" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n4" target="n5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e12" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n5" target="n6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e13" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n7" target="n8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e14" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n8" target="n9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e15" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.2;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n6" target="n10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e16" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.8;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n9" target="n10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n17" value="&lt;b&gt;Agree?&lt;/b&gt; A role's reviewers are less than 25 points apart. If not, the role is not at target whatever its average: fix what they reported and review again with fresh reviewers." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="540" width="330" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n18" value="&lt;b&gt;At target?&lt;/b&gt; Every role of every journey at the target, say 90, in one full run, with the reviewers of each role agreeing." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontStyle=0;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="395" y="540" width="330" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n19" value="&lt;b&gt;Strict enough?&lt;/b&gt; On the control journey: planted defects reported at least 0.67 of the time, or too kind; things known to be right flagged at most 0.34 of the time, or too harsh." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="540" width="330" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e20" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.2;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n10" target="n17"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e21" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n10" target="n18"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e22" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=0.8;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n10" target="n19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n23" value='&lt;b&gt;Worked example, from the tests.&lt;/b&gt; Accessibility: one reviewer gives 70, the other 85 but lists a major contrast issue, so it counts as 74: the role scores &lt;b&gt;72&lt;/b&gt;. Interaction: 95 and 60 average &lt;b&gt;77.5&lt;/b&gt; and are 35 apart, so the reviewers &lt;b&gt;disagree&lt;/b&gt;: not at target, even against a target of 60. The loop fixes what the 60 reported, "nothing confirms the payment", commits, and reviews again with fresh reviewers. Both now give 95: interaction scores &lt;b&gt;95&lt;/b&gt;, agreed.' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="690" width="1040" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
